presentation group "Activities":
- question text is "Which activities do you enjoy? Select all that apply.".
- question description is "Demo note: This description is optional and is authored in CRL. Each activity has its own answer. Mixed means unanswered, checked means Yes, and unchecked means No. Clear returns a choice to unanswered.".
- columns is 3.
- control is checkbox.

presentation for "Read a Book":
- question text is "Read a Book".
- choice group is "Activities".

presentation for "Take a Walk":
- question text is "Take a Walk".
- choice group is "Activities".

presentation for "Listen to Music":
- question text is "Listen to Music".
- choice group is "Activities".

presentation for "Draw a Picture":
- question text is "Draw a Picture".
- choice group is "Activities".

presentation for "Play a Game":
- question text is "Play a Game".
- choice group is "Activities".

presentation for "Watch a Film":
- question text is "Watch a Film".
- choice group is "Activities".

activity "certify.Met":
- request CPGTaskRequest.
- with `Met`.

activity "not-certify.Unmet":
- request CPGTaskRequest.
- with `Unmet`.

decision "Activity Review":
first:
- when "Read a Book" or "Take a Walk" or "Listen to Music" or "Draw a Picture" or "Play a Game" or "Watch a Film" then recommend activity "certify.Met".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Unmet".
